        <mxCell id="scope-note" value="Source: notifications/notification.service.js and authenticated notification routes/repository. GET and POST are distinct requests. All current signed-in roles can use their own recipient scope. No GET command store, assignment, payment or outbound delivery is introduced. Repeated read acknowledgement can return ALREADY_READ." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;spacing=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
